  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of $x^n$ in expansion of $(1+x)(1-x)^n$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$(n-1)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(-1)^n(1-n)$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(-1)^{n-1}(n-1)^2$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(-1)^{n-1} n$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Coefficient of $x^n$ in $(1+x)(1-x)^n=(1+x)\\left({ }^n C_0-{ }^n C_1 x+\\ldots \\ldots .+(-1)^{n-1}{ }^n C_{n-1} x^{n-1}+(-1)^n\\right.$\n$\\left.{ }^n C_n x^n\\right)$\n$=(-1)^n{ }^n C_n+(-1)^{n-1}{ }^n C_{n-1}=(-1)^n(1-n)$"
  }
}